OL,3,GNEWSARiver topped up after driest July
OL,4,Asince 2006
OL,5,
OL,6,FA river is being topped up by a
OL,7,Freservoir to maintain legally mandated
OL,8,Fwater levels.
OL,10,FWater from Kielder Reservoir has been
OL,11,Freleased into the River Wear since 13
OL,12,FJuly, according to the Environment
OL,13,FAgency (EA).
OL,15,FLast month was the driest July
OL,16,Fexperienced by north-east England since
OL,17,F2006.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,450,440,260,160,0,100
