OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSARiver topped up after driest July
OL,4,Asince 2006
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe EA said rainfall in the Wear
OL,7,Fcatchment was "exceptionally low" and
OL,8,Fwas only about 13% of the long-term
OL,9,Faverage. Durham, for example, on
OL,10,Faverage gets 61mm of rain in July,
OL,11,Faccording to the Met Office.
